      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>July 22, 2025</color>\nNicole Reeyn of the Hexenzirkel, codename \"N\"\n\"You wish to hear a story of the moon? That tale begins long, long ago...\"\n<color=#ffacff>HoYoLAB:</color> <color=#37ffff>https:/www.hoyolab.com/article/40132513</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Character Announcement"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/04/13/151578876/4d684f67c639325da2d4255c192c46f2_2546418159524254233.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>April 13, 2026</color>\n...\"Editor of Magical Memory Bubbles,\"\"Staunch Supporter of Squirrels,\" \"A Super-Creative Who Needs Only Think to Get Things Done\"...\n\"Alice? Why are the titles on the spell formula getting longer and longer?\"\n— Thus did a voiceless mage protest, albeit in vain.\n<color=#ffacff>HoYoLAB:</color> <color=#37ffff>https:/www.hoyolab.com/article/44627867</color>"
      },
      {
